<title>EGYPT: Egypt cotton export prices steady till March 15.</title>
<headline>Egypt cotton export prices steady till March 15.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Alexandria Cotton Exporters Association (Alcotexa) said on Tuesday it left cotton export prices unchanged in this week of the 96/97 marketing season.</p>
<p>The prices, valid until 2200 GMT on March 15, are listed below in centilibres (U.S. cents per lb):</p>
<p>	   FG/EX FG+1/4 FG   FG-1/4 G/FG G+3/8</p>
<p>Giza 76  181.0 175.0 169.0 163.0 157.0 154.0 Giza 70  174.0 168.0 162.0 156.0 150.0 147.0 Giza 77  169.0 163.0 157.0 151.0 145.0 142.0 Giza 75  142.0 136.0 130.0 124.0 118.0 115.0 Giza 85  131.0 125.0 119.0 113.0 107.0 104.0 Giza 83  127.0 121.0 115.0 109.0 103.0 100.0 Giza 80  127.0 121.0 115.0 109.0 103.0 100.0 Note - FG/EX = fully good/excellent, G/FG = good/fully good</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
